{"data": [{"author_id": "117396786", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:25:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115328961895153893"], "id": "2115328961895153893", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "会社融通効かない…", "url": "https://x.com/panandpan/status/2115328961895153893"}, {"author_id": "1938063797098582019", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:54:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115774369654063550"], "id": "2115774369654063550", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 327, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115770658693255316", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "资本的力量一旦与社会结构脱节就会像现在这样\nA股没有社融 没有资本 没有增量\n这与广大股民的诉求就脱节了\n\n体现更广一点就是广大人民群众所需求所向往的生活达到不了久而久之就产生矛盾了\n\n但世界就是这样在矛盾中产生解决了一个矛盾又会有新的矛盾出来\n\n抓住了矛盾的关键点就能置于矛盾之上 https://t.co/FD1mJYbNlN", "url": "https://x.com/WGiordanol66/status/2115774369654063550"}, {"author_id": "1873024376834277377", "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:57:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115382388700430754"], "id": "2115382388700430754", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 3155, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115377544925237585", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "各新云老云，都以类似的表外主体，设计了特殊spv进行了大量社会融资，这些融资支撑了nvda博通之类及其上游内存cpu光通信的半导体短期繁荣，所以ant及open https://t.co/Z4xc4cpL6W", "url": "https://x.com/Victory_1919/status/2115382388700430754"}, {"author_id": "1873024376834277377", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:17:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115734648399577094"], "id": "2115734648399577094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2410, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115462650125815835", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "高盛在本月早些时候的一份报告中表示，今年美元投资级债券发行额已超过 1.5 万亿美元，这使得 2026 年有望打破疫情时代之前的纪录